{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はひな祭りだよー\n女の子の日です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お昼にちらし寿司と\n桜餅といちご大福食べた。\nいちご大福さまさまさま！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毛糸や布で三つ編みするだけで\nかわいくみえる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レースとかビーズとか\nスパンコールとか...\nものづくり楽しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ぐわっ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だーれだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今から大量質問回答～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな男の子の服装はー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私自身、シャツが好きだから\n着てたらいいなって思います。\nシャツにゆるいのとか良いですね。\nあと、靴下がかわいかったり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなお菓子教えてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今和菓子めっちゃすき♪\nあと干し梅のお菓子とか\n昔からずっとすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかが思う乃木坂のメンバーで\n１番マイペースなのは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまと！\nあえてまいまいと言わない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいはマイペースなのかな。\n天然ふわーんて感じ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握とか個握、何回か行っても\n大丈夫？困ったりしない？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで困るんだ！\n嬉しいに決まってるじゃないか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アジカンのライブいったことある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はライブとか行ったことないの。\nはあー行きたいなあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柔道してる人どう思いますか!?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強そう！かっこいい。\n私、空手少しやったことあるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやってないに近いけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際に定期とケーキ\n間違えたことある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際駅でケーキ片手に持ち歩く人\nいるのかしら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...え？私？...私のことなの？！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？ゲラって何？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょーもないことで\n大笑いしてしまう人。\nそのままツボにはまって\n笑い続けるひとのことだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は春から高校１年生に\nなるんですけど、万理華ちゃんは、\n初めの自己紹介ってどんな感じで\nやりましたか？覚えていなかったら、\nアドバイス下さい！(^^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わあ、思い出したら懐かしい。\nあの頃の髪型、おでこあげて\nポニーテールだったんだよな...\n私はさらっと言って終わった！\n(クールキャラ狙って)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの頃の第一印象を友達に聞いたら\n「大人しそう」「頭良さそう」\n「新体操習ってそう」でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふは\nクールどこ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2年のときなんて\n「1年から来ました」で\n大コケしたからね笑\n私のは参考にならないのばっかだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハキハキしゃべるのが一番"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私みたいにキャラ作ったら\n失敗する可能性が高いので\nやめた方が良いです！\n...って言っても学校の自己紹介って\n妙に緊張しちゃうんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長くなってごめんなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年下でも呼び方は\n何でもありですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度の全握で行こうと思うのですが\n名前は何と呼べばいいですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呼び方に困ったら「まりっか」\nって呼んでください！\n年下とか、年齢なんて関係ないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持っている服のなかで一番\n気に入ってる服はどんな服ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいあるから\n一つに絞れません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々推しだけど握手会で\nまりかに会いに行ってもいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい。ぜひっ\nねねの相方はこんな感じかあ\nってわかるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかが名字で呼んでる\nメンバーっているのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒！せいたんとひなは\n時々呼び捨て！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもお洋服どこで買ってるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルミネもラフォーレも行く！\nAMBIDEXの服とってもかわいい^^*\n古着屋も行くよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お肉派よりお魚派？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちもすきー\n今は魚よく食べるー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニーとか行かないのｰ?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり自分から\n行こうとしないな。\nねえ、誰か誘って←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段から肩にお洋服\n巻いたりするの？\nあと、春服でどういうのが\n欲しいとかあるのかなー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩にかけるアイディアはママ。\n挑戦しようと思う。\n今狙ってる服あるから\n買いに行きたいなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一発芸は好きですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日村さんのトドすき♪\nFUJIWARAの原西さんの\nギャグもすき！とんち！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト終わって今１番\nやりたいことってなに(^^)？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"整体に行って雑貨屋巡りして\nカフェでまったりしたい。\nそしてガンガンお仕事！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVに出て来た白熊の名前は\n何て言うの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しろくまりっくまっていいます。\n詳細は295回目の記事に載せてるので\nぜひ見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はちっちゃい頃の\n写真見てました...\nちっちゃい頃の髪型って\nなんでもありだな。ファンキー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1つ目のなんともいえない顔が\n多かったなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2つ目めっちゃ睨んでおる！こわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3つ目、笑ってる！貴重貴重。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤い服いっぱい着てたな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/03/2065598/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに小さい時もあったんだな。\nあらためておでこ広いな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日も頑張りまりか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま り か"}],"source":"archive"}